Rebuild (from the repository root, with VITASDK configured):
cmake -S knife/vita/vendor/shacccg-ext/source -B .work/shacccg-ext -G Ninja \
  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE="$VITASDK/share/vita.toolchain.cmake" \
  -DCMAKE_C_FLAGS="-march=armv7-a -mfloat-abi=hard -I$PWD/knife/vita/vendor/dependencies/include" \
  -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="-march=armv7-a -mfloat-abi=hard -I$PWD/knife/vita/vendor/dependencies/include"
cmake --build .work/shacccg-ext
Copy the output archive and update its pinned checksum in knife/vita/CMakeLists.txt.
The separate runtime compiler module is in ../shacccg/.
